{"headword":"נַחֲלָה","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.f. possession, property, inheritance (</strong>orig. <em>gift;</em> NH = BH<strong>)</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">נ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 18:23\" href=\"/Numbers.18.23\">Nu 18:23</a> +; <span dir=\"rtl\">נַחֲלָת</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 16:6\" href=\"/Psalms.16.6\">ψ 16:6</a> (Ges<sup>§ 80 g</sup>), read <span dir=\"rtl\">נַחֲלָתִי</span> Ew SS We Kö<sup>ii 1, 425</sup>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">נַחֲלַת</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 13:23\" href=\"/Joshua.13.23\">Jos 13:23</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">נַחֲלָתִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Ruth 4:6\" href=\"/Ruth.4.6\">Ru 4:6</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">נַחֲלַתְכֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 105:11\" href=\"/Psalms.105.11\">ψ 105:11</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">נְחָלוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 49:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.49.8\">Is 49:8</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">נְחָלֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 19:51\" href=\"/Joshua.19.51\">Jos 19:51</a>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>property:</em>"},{"senses":[{"definition":"in Canaan given by <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> to Israel, †<span dir=\"rtl\">נחלת ישׂראל</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 20:6\" href=\"/Judges.20.6\">Ju 20:6</a>; †<span dir=\"rtl\">נ׳ יעקב</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 58:14\" href=\"/Isaiah.58.14\">Is 58:14</a>, especially †<span dir=\"rtl\">אֲשֶׁר נֹתֵן לְךָ נַחֲלָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 4:21\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.4.21\">Dt 4:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 15:4\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.15.4\">15:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 19:10\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.19.10\">19:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 20:16\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.20.16\">20:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 21:23\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.21.23\">21:23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 24:4\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.24.4\">24:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 25:19\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.25.19\">25:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 26:1\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.26.1\">26:1</a> (all D); <span dir=\"rtl\">הנחלה אש